Changes in this distribution, relative to that upstream project:

- Optional conversion of hardcoded subtitles to Traditional Chinese
  (OpenCC s2twp, Taiwan wording), exposed in the CLI and the GUI.
- Optional Traditional SRT export and a --burn-srt path that burns a
  corrected SRT back onto the erased region.
- Bundled Noto Sans CJK TC (SIL Open Font License 1.1). See backend/fonts/OFL.txt.
- Official upstream LAMA, ProPainter, and STTN weights, kept in the upstream
  split-part layout with fs_manifest.csv and stored with Git LFS.
- The assembled LAMA filename checked before merging split parts is big-lama.pt.

